cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Four Layers of Memory: a typed memory substrate for long-horizon language agents"
abstract: >-
  A small, dependency-free reference implementation of a four-layer memory
  substrate (conventions, preferences, capabilities, background) for
  long-horizon language agents, with provenance-bound admission, watermark-driven
  consolidation, snapshot-cursor handoff, and a signed audit ledger.
